radial_n=3;                 // Radial screws: Base 10: how a tool locks onto the hub: M3 screws in from the tool plate's side into the hub's rim, as Seeed's stock gripper does (Connector B to A: 3 at 120 deg). Loosen 3 screws, lift the tool off, slide the next one on.
